These .wasm files are third-party software redistributed with J.H AI Agent.

This file travels with them because a compiled .wasm carries no notice of its own,
and MIT requires the copyright and permission notices to be included in all copies.
Vite copies this directory verbatim into the build, so the notices ship with the app.

Every notice below was transcribed verbatim from the published package's own LICENSE
file (via `npm pack <name>@<version>`), not reconstructed. See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
at the repo root for the audit and for how to re-verify.

════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
COPYRIGHT HOLDERS
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

tree-sitter.wasm — the tree-sitter runtime
    from web-tree-sitter (https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter)
    Copyright (c) 2018-2021 Max Brunsfeld
    MIT

tree-sitter-javascript.wasm
    compiled from tree-sitter-javascript@0.20.3
    (https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-javascript)
    Copyright (c) 2014 Max Brunsfeld
    MIT

tree-sitter-python.wasm
    compiled from tree-sitter-python@0.21.0
    (https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-python)
